import H0mework.Physics.SynchronizedJoint.FixedActionJetNaturality

/-!
# Whole-action-jet naturality of the action-selected gravity tail

The fixed gravity-tail occurrence has already emitted one global actual and
its all-point connection first jet.  This module compares that exact output
with the native recentered Cartan--EC contact generated by the same
occurrence prefix.  The typed seam is formed only after both action jets
exist; it is a read-after-write normal form, never a writer input.
-/

namespace
  SaturationMonoid.PhysicsCore.StageNineDiracDualFormNativeFixedP506ActionSelectedGravityTailActionJetNaturality

